The {{Term/Store|Rubber Helm||Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Rubber Helm, along with the [[Rubber Armor]] and [[Rubber Tights]], comprise the [[Rubber Armor (Set)|Rubber Armor]] set. The Helm can be acquired by completing the "[[Thunder Magnet]]" [[Side Quest]] at [[Lakeside Stable]]. It provides [[Link]] with three defense and a level of [[Shock Resistance]]. After completing the quest, it will be available to purchase from [[Granté]] in [[Tarrey Town]].

